    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671180/extras/ce8175ecf069f6bc2a8134191f4d7700.avif?t=1726081329\" width=630 height=250 /></span><br>Infected Frontier is a polygon zombie survival looter shooter with base building and crafting. <br>Story and Missions - Immerse yourself in an exciting story and complete missions to earn unique rewards and advance the plot. <br>Your only goal is survival, everything else is optional.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671180/extras/1e264d5bf55d32f35a077f83fe9ab951.avif?t=1726081329\" width=630 height=250 /></span><br><br>Play Your Way - Play single player, online server based multiplayer, or online co-op with friends.<br>Character Creation - Create a character just for you.<br>Base Building.<br>Crafting - Create hundreds of items for all types of situations.<br>Scavenging - Search the world or kill enemies to find items.<br>Gathering - Raw materials like wood, stone, metal, and more.<br>Gun Customization - Find and craft many different attachments to build a gun that suits your playstyle.<br>Survival Mechanics - Keep your hunger and thirst under control to stay alive.<br>Fishing - Simple fishing system to find food.<br>Collect - There are hundreds of unique items to collect.<br>Date, Time, and Climate Systems.<br>Inventory management.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671180/extras/ce8175ecf069f6bc2a8134191f4d7700.avif?t=1726081329\" width=630 height=250 /></span><br>Infected Frontier is a polygon zombie survival looter shooter with base building and crafting. <br>Story and Missions - Immerse yourself in an exciting story and complete missions to earn unique rewards and advance the plot. <br>Your only goal is survival, everything else is optional.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671180/extras/1e264d5bf55d32f35a077f83fe9ab951.avif?t=1726081329\" width=630 height=250 /></span><br><br>Play Your Way - Play single player, online server based multiplayer, or online co-op with friends.<br>Character Creation - Create a character just for you.<br>Base Building.<br>Crafting - Create hundreds of items for all types of situations.<br>Scavenging - Search the world or kill enemies to find items.<br>Gathering - Raw materials like wood, stone, metal, and more.<br>Gun Customization - Find and craft many different attachments to build a gun that suits your playstyle.<br>Survival Mechanics - Keep your hunger and thirst under control to stay alive.<br>Fishing - Simple fishing system to find food.<br>Collect - There are hundreds of unique items to collect.<br>Date, Time, and Climate Systems.<br>Inventory management.",
